          "description": "The joint chem_opt = 170 column at model step 790 (19:10 LST), an evening shower: WSM6 rain, so wetdep_ls removes sulf at every rainy layer. Reference: data/eqwefic/chem170_scm/run_full_mosaic.sh (the run_full.sh configuration -- emiss_opt = 4, emiss_inpt_opt = 101, bio_emiss_opt = 1, wetscav_onoff = -1, cu_physics = 0 -- with the MOSAIC hooks and the ASTEM tape; fork ctessum-claude/WRF branch earthsciml-instrumented-chem170, binary chem170_full/bin). THE STATE is the one ASTEM's first semi-volatile sub-step forms its fluxes at: per section MOSAIC's last aerosol_phase_state call of the step (ps_*_c2), per level the condensing gases of the tape's first sub-step (SVT), every other gas KPP's output of the step; CBM-Z's four exchanging gases are put in molec/cm3 by inverting the document's own down chain, so ASTEM is handed the tape's gases. Inputs the Fortran's solvers decided are taken as the Fortran left them, as in couplings/mosaic_column.esm: ah2o_a (Kelvin), the MESA solid on path 6, dp_wet. Expected values, all at that one state, real64: CBM-Z's Vdot with RCONST recomputed at the state (kernels/cbmz_driver), conv times the emissions_driver increment over dt, vertmx with K = 0 (Romberg dt -> 0) and wetdep_ls (sulf) replayed at the state; ASTEM's phase state, thermodynamics and rates from the in-model tape (fill_mosaic_column_tests.py's selection); nucleation, coagulation and aerosol dry deposition replayed at the state's rsub (chem170_full/replay_joint.py: nucleation fires at 8 of 59 levels); and the join -- ASTEM's dgas and nucleation's uptake handed back to H2SO4, HNO3, HCl and NH3, ASTEM's condensation added to the components -- on the 12 levels whose eight ASTEM fluxes were formed at the state (levels [36, 40, 41, 42, 43, 44, 47, 48, 49, 50, 55, 59]); there the four exchanging gases' column tendencies are asserted with the exchange in them, elsewhere not at all. Census of the gas-particle part: {\"('path', 1, 0)\": 28, \"('path', 2, 0)\": 226, \"('path', 5, 0)\": 23, \"('path', 6, 1)\": 12, \"('path', 6, 2)\": 174, \"('path', 6, 3)\": 9, 'kel_skipped_mesa_snap': 45, 'kel_skipped_unconverged': 9, 'level_edited_between_bins': 38, 'level_excluded:mesa_ptc water stale (unconverged or snapped)': 9, 'levels_with_rates': 12, 'liquid_thermo': 263, 'mc_h_case3': 127, 'state_skipped_unconverged': 9}. Tolerances: the three parts' own (rel 1e-10 and the deposition bound for CBM-Z, rel 1e-9 and the parts' floors for MOSAIC), rel 1e-9 plus the parts' floors on the join. Filled by tools/fill_chem170_column_tests.py.",
